		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":1} -->
<h1 class="wp-block-heading">Welcome to the Highlight and Share Demo</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You can highlight any of this text and see several social sharing networks.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:shortcode -->
[has_click_to_share theme="purple" max_width="650px" margin="25px 0 20px 0"]You can click me to show social networks as well. I am a Click to Share block.[/has_click_to_share]
<!-- /wp:shortcode -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You are also able to inline highlight text. This is <span class="has-inline-text has-inline-text">a quick example of inline highlighting</span>, which you can click on to share some social networks.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:separator {"backgroundColor":"palette-color-4","className":"is-style-dots"} -->
<hr class="wp-block-separator has-text-color has-palette-color-4-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-palette-color-4-background-color has-background is-style-dots"/>
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you hover over the image below, you'll see some share buttons.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"id":24,"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none","align":"center"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large"><img src="https://has.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/237807828_eb98cda93b_k-1024x692.jpg" alt="Lighting Strike in Phoenix, Arizona" class="wp-image-24"/><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Lighting Strike in Phoenix, Arizona</figcaption></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>When you are ready, <a href="/wp-admin/options-general.php?page=highlight-and-share">head to the admin settings</a> so you can see the many ways to configure this plugin.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
